In my last game I had very long sac-and-polyfest which included dozens
of unicorn horns, and got maybe three magic markers out of it. I found
I had much better luck polypiling the *scrolls* instead. I got tons of
enchant armor and enchant weapon that way. It helps if you bless the
scrolls first and arrange them in piles of no more than four.

FWIW, though, in "normal" games (keeping in mind I rarely ascend in
fewer than 70K turns, which most consider slow), I usually have no
problem getting most of my armor to +4/+5. I just wanted more enchant
scrolls in my last game to 1) give enchanted armor and weapons to my
pets and 2) try to get more highly-enchanted items, like +7 shirts and
shields, and +8 daggers.

